// Reference articles added by the knowledge-base expansion. Same shape as
// reference.js: { id, title, icon, summary, sections }, where a section has
// `heading`, `body` and an optional `table: { headers, rows }`.
//
// Every figure keeps a plain-word label for how far it can be trusted:
// maker’s sheet, standard’s own text, one source, supplier listing, typical,
// forum practice, or our judgement. Facts from ETA, Witschi, Soprod and ISO
// documents are always restated in the app’s own words, never reproduced.

